e fears are similar to yours and accept their trials so that they can help you overcome your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726100/extras/cda5223c8a0180da66ce4727ee2b2955.poster.avif?t=1773567297\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726100/extras/cda5223c8a0180da66ce4727ee2b2955.webm?t=1773567297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726100/extras/cda5223c8a0180da66ce4727ee2b2955.mp4?t=1773567297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you guide the hero through this world of nightmares and bring him peace, or will fear consume yet another soul?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Origiway Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726100/3c92c26273c511a928ad476534864b58959258a0/header.jpg?t=1773567297","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3726100/2117906812/26d1f7abab1f4163b89ff1bd8716bccc402dbeaa/1757664138/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758964678","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3726100/2117906812/26d1f7abab1f4163b89ff1bd8716bccc402dbeaa/1757664138/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758964678","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/37