ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726100/383926c99c372c5446f1e8a809330ed8a7307bf2/ss_383926c99c372c5446f1e8a809330ed8a7307bf2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773567297","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726100/383926c99c372c5446f1e8a809330ed8a7307bf2/ss_383926c99c372c5446f1e8a809330ed8a7307bf2.600x338.jpg?t=1773567297"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726100/388dd4ed72087372db5fb0d18b6d014d29c64427/ss_388dd4ed72087372db5fb0d18b6d014d29c64427.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773567297","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726100/388dd4ed72087372db5fb0d18b6d014d29c64427/ss_388dd4ed72087372db5fb0d18b6d014d29c64427.600x338.jpg?t=1773567297"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726100/23d8ac4de166b9193f6304ab7585ec0f89b76186/ss_23d8ac4de166b9193f6304ab7585ec0f89b76186.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773567297","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726100/23d8ac4de166b9193f6304ab7585ec0f89b76186/ss_23d8ac4de166b9193f6304ab7585ec0f89b76186.600x338.jpg?t=1773567297"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726100/c63fd1280fea6cb4e8496a2592ca89bceb088801/ss_c63fd1280fea6cb4e8496a2592ca89bceb088801.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773567297","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726100/c63fd1280fea6cb4e8496a2592ca89bceb088801/ss_c63fd1280fea6cb4e8496a2592ca89bceb088801.600x338.jpg?t=1773567297"}],"short_description":"Forestless is an atmospheric psychological adventure that takes you on a journey through the world of fear, armed only with the magical arrow of hope. Explore the vastness of human nightmares, from the foggy lands of loneliness to the mountains of failure.","steam_appid":3726100,"support_info":{"email":"ivanukey@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French,